Package: zufastbench
Title: Compare 'zufast' Number Parsing with 'RcppFastFloat'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Z", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A tools-only package, not for release. It compiles the 'zufast'
    headers into C++ next to the 'fast_float' headers that 'RcppFastFloat'
    ships, and runs both, and the C library's parsers, through the same
    harness: the benchmark of 'RcppFastFloat' (inst/benchmark/comparison.R)
    with 'zufast' added. Its tests check that the parsers agree.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: zufast, Rcpp, RcppFastFloat
Imports: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), microbenchmark
Config/testthat/edition: 3
